{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.2"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-034",
    "title": "归墟盟主"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_209",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "“等他们要求我替他们决定谁该失去名字。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "陆照临进入天门后，玄霄宗的山门内战开始了。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6068,
          "end": 6068
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "掌门闭关未出，九位长老在议事殿分成两列。左列主张立即关闭天门，右列主张趁门缝尚未稳定时进入其中，夺回被太虚遗脉吸收的残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6070,
          "end": 6070
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“持印者已经进入门内。”守门长老说，“若不封门，灵脉会继续倒灌。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6072,
          "end": 6072
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封门便等于放弃两枚残印。”开门长老反驳，“三百年前的封存工程已经证明，太虚遗脉无法被永久压制。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6074,
          "end": 6074
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "议事殿中央摆着一只黑漆木盒。盒盖上刻着陆照临的名字，名字旁边有一道被削去的空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6076,
          "end": 6076
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋站在殿外，没有人邀请她入席。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6078,
          "end": 6078
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她参与过三年前的点灯。”一名长老说，“证词应当公开。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6080,
          "end": 6080
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“她只是外门执事。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6082,
          "end": 6082
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“外门执事没有资格接触第三盏灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6084,
          "end": 6084
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋推门进入：“那就说明宗门的记录一直在撒谎。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6086,
          "end": 6086
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有人转头看她。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6088,
          "end": 6088
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋，你可知擅闯议事殿的罪名？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6090,
          "end": 6090
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6092,
          "end": 6092
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你还敢来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6094,
          "end": 6094
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为你们要用我的证词决定关门还是开门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6096,
          "end": 6096
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把一张折叠的纸放在桌上。纸上写着雪原点灯记录，落款是她自己的名字。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6098,
          "end": 6098
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三年前冬至前七日，我在雪原点亮第三盏灯。陆沉舟把灯交给我，要求我把它带回玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6100,
          "end": 6100
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你没有带回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6102,
          "end": 6102
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为灯火中出现了天门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6104,
          "end": 6104
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么隐瞒？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6106,
          "end": 6106
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为我看见门里的人没有名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6108,
          "end": 6108
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老拍桌：“这不是理由。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6110,
          "end": 6110
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那我再说一个理由。”沈砚秋抬头，“当时下令删史的人，就坐在这里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6112,
          "end": 6112
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "殿中一阵骚动。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6114,
          "end": 6114
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "九位长老互相看着，没有人承认。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6116,
          "end": 6116
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老冷声道：“旧事与今日无关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6118,
          "end": 6118
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“今日的天门就是旧事留下的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6120,
          "end": 6120
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把证词翻到背面。背面还有一段被火燎过的文字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6122,
          "end": 6122
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“若第三盏灯再次点亮，玄霄宗必须选择守门或开门。守门者失去灵脉，开门者失去名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6124,
          "end": 6124
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是你写的？”守门长老问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6126,
          "end": 6126
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是我从陆沉舟手里抄下的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6128,
          "end": 6128
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你当时为何不呈报？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6130,
          "end": 6130
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为呈报之后，纸会被裁掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6132,
          "end": 6132
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "议事殿外突然传来钟声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6134,
          "end": 6134
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗山门九盏灯同时熄灭，唯独钟楼顶端的空灯亮起青火。火焰照出一条通往天门的影子，影子里站着陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6136,
          "end": 6136
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老拔剑：“他正在返回。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6138,
          "end": 6138
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那不是返回。”沈砚秋说，“是门把他的影子送回来。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6140,
          "end": 6140
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "影子走进议事殿，停在黑漆木盒前。木盒上的名字开始变化，陆照临三个字逐渐褪色，露出下面另一行：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6142,
          "end": 6142
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“持印者，暂代门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6144,
          "end": 6144
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老伸手去抓木盒。影子抬起手，议事殿所有灯盏同时碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6146,
          "end": 6146
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“门楔不能被任何一方带走。”沈砚秋说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6148,
          "end": 6148
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你想保护陆照临？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6150,
          "end": 6150
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我想保护选择。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6152,
          "end": 6152
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老挥剑斩向影子。剑锋穿过影子，落在黑漆木盒上。木盒裂开，里面滚出一枚青铜碎片。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6154,
          "end": 6154
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "碎片上刻满名字，最上方三行已经削平。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6156,
          "end": 6156
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老立刻拾起碎片：“这是门楔。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6158,
          "end": 6158
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“放下。”沈砚秋说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6160,
          "end": 6160
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗不能再被动等待。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6162,
          "end": 6162
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他将碎片按进自己的额头。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6164,
          "end": 6164
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青光从他眉心炸开。长老的脸上浮出无数青色纹路，声音也变得空洞：“开门，归还一切。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6166,
          "end": 6166
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门长老后退：“他被遗脉承载了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6168,
          "end": 6168
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "开门长老抬手，殿内十余名弟子同时转身，剑尖指向守门派。玄霄宗内部终于拔剑相向。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6170,
          "end": 6170
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有拔剑。她走到钟楼下，取出那把旧铜钥匙，插进空灯底座。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6172,
          "end": 6172
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯火熄灭，山门外的天门影子却更加清晰。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6174,
          "end": 6174
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "没有人回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6182,
          "end": 6182
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "归来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6254,
          "end": 6254
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你刚才说不认识。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-075",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6412,
          "end": 6412
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我说的是现在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-076",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6414,
          "end": 6414
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主转身走向城门，临走前将白色骨牌抛给叶观澜。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-077",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6416,
          "end": 6416
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三日后，归墟盟总坛开会。你若不带陆照临回来，便不再是盟使。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-078",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6418,
          "end": 6418
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜握住骨牌：“那我就不回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-079",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6420,
          "end": 6420
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主停步：“你可以不回去，但你的名字会被从盟册上删掉。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-080",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6422,
          "end": 6422
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜看着他：“删掉不等于不存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-081",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6424,
          "end": 6424
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "盟主没有回答，继续下城。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-082",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6426,
          "end": 6426
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向叶观澜：“你背叛归墟盟了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-083",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6428,
          "end": 6428
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还没有。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-084",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6430,
          "end": 6430
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“什么时候会？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-085",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6432,
          "end": 6432
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“等他们要求我替他们决定谁该失去名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-086",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 6434,
          "end": 6434
        }
      }
    ],
